Playbooks: YAML files defining automation tasks.

Inventory: List of managed hosts.

Modules: Units of work executed on hosts (e.g., install packages).

Roles: Reusable playbook components.

Handlers: Tasks triggered after specific conditions (e.g., restart services).

Variables: Store dynamic values for use in playbooks.

Templates: Jinja2-based dynamic content generation.

Ansible Tower: Web UI for managing Ansible.

Ansible Galaxy: Repository for community-contributed roles.

Ad-Hoc Commands: One-time commands run on hosts.

Facts: System properties gathered from hosts automatically.

Collections: Bundles of Ansible content for easier sharing.
